{"parentUuid":"b1a166b0-9593-4d73-a0cc-f416d26f95f4","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"edited_text_file","filename":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\prime-silo\\.worktrees\\Q0\\runtime\\CLAUDE.md","snippet":"1\t# Benny — Agent Navigation Guide\n2\t\n3\tThis is a **local-first, multi-model AI orchestration platform**. Key facts before you start:\n4\t\n5\t## Architecture in one sentence\n6\tA FastAPI backend + React/Three.js frontend + Neo4j knowledge/code graph + LangGraph swarm executor + **Pypes declarative transformation engine**, all portable under `$BENNY_HOME`.\n7\t\n8\t## Four capability surfaces\n9\t\n10\tBenny treats **documents**, **code**, **tabular data**, and the **operator cockpit** as first-class:\n11\t\n12\t- **Documents** → RAG / Knowledge Graph (`benny/api/rag_routes.py`, `benny/core/adaptive_rag.py`)\n13\t- **Code** → Code Graph + Swarm execution (`benny/api/graph_routes.py`, `benny/graph/swarm.py`)\n14\t- **Tabular data** → Pypes transformation engine (`benny/pypes/`, `benny/api/pypes_routes.py`) — manifest-driven DAG with bronze→silver→gold stages, CLP lineage, checkpoints, drill-down, and explainable financial-risk reports. Plus a **sandbox layer** (`pypes plan` / `agent-report` / `bench` / `chat`) for LLM manifest authoring, agent narratives, pandas-vs-polars benchmarks, and multi-turn drill-down — all advisory and side-effect-free relative to the deterministic core. See [docs/operations/PYPES_TRANSFORMATION_GUIDE.md](docs/operations/PYPES_TRANSFORMATION_GUIDE.md).\n15\t- **Operator cockpit** → AgentAmp (`benny/agentamp/`, `frontend/src/agentamp/`) — Winamp-style skinnable cockpit. **Phases 1–6 shipped**: `.aamp` skin packs + HMAC signing (`scaffold-skin / pack / sign / install`); AgentVis WebGL plugin sandbox (Phase 2); DSP-A deterministic spectrum/VU/loop pipeline (Phase 3); Textual TUI mini-mode (Phase 4); Equalizer manifest write + policy/ledger (Phase 5); Playlist run-history + enqueue + Layout DSL snap/clamp + user-state portability export/import (Phase 6). Phases 7–9 (effects pipeline, marketplace, release hardening) are next. See [docs/operations/AGENTAMP_GUIDE.md](docs/operations/AGENTAMP_GUIDE.md).\n16\t\n17\t## Where things live\n18\t\n19\t| What | Where |\n20\t|------|-------|\n21\t| **Backend API** (FastAPI, 24 route modules) | `benny/api/` |\n22\t| **Pypes transformation engine** (DAG manifests, CLP lineage, drill-down) | `benny/pypes/` + `benny/api/pypes_routes.py` |\n23\t| **AgentAmp cockpit** (skin packs, signing, scaffold, plugins) | `benny/agentamp/` + `frontend/src/agentamp/` |\n24\t| **CLI entry point** | `benny_cli.py` |\n25\t| **Frontend** (React 19, Three.js, Vite) | `frontend/src/` |\n26\t| **Swarm executor** (LangGraph) | `benny/graph/swarm.py` |\n27\t| **Planner** (requirement → manifest) | `benny/graph/manifest_runner.py` |\n28\t| **LLM router + offline guard** | `benny/core/models.py` |\n29\t| **Knowledge graph (RAG, concepts)** | `benny/api/rag_routes.py` + `benny/core/adaptive_rag.py` |\n30\t| **Code graph (Tree-Sitter AST)** | `benny/api/graph_routes.py` + `benny/graph/code_analyzer.py` |\n31\t| **Neo4j driver** | `benny/core/graph_db.py` |\n32\t| **Governance / audit / lineage** | `benny/governance/` |\n33\t| **Portable home (init/up/down)** | `benny/portable/` |\n34\t| **MCP server for Claude** | `benny/mcp/server.py` |\n35\t| **Docker services** | `docker-compose.yml` (Neo4j, Marquez, Phoenix, N8N) |\n36\t\n37\t## Key CLI commands\n38\t\n39\t```bash\n40\tbenny plan \"<requirement>\" --workspace <ws> --save   # LLM-generate manifest\n41\tbenny run <manifest.json> --json                      # execute manifest\n42\tbenny runs ls --limit 10                              # run history\n43\tbenny enrich --workspace c5_test --src src/dangpy --run               # enrichment (inline mode)\n44\tbenny enrich --manifest manifests/templates/knowledge_enrichment_pipeline.json \\\n45\t             --workspace c5_test --src src/dangpy --run                # enrichment (declarative v2.0)\n46\tbenny enrich --manifest <path> --resume <prior_run_id> --run           # resume a partial run\n47\tbenny pypes inspect manifests/templates/financial_risk_pipeline.json   # validate a pypes manifest\n48\tbenny pypes run     manifests/templates/financial_risk_pipeline.json --workspace pypes_demo\n49\tbenny pypes drilldown <run_id> gold_exposure --workspace pypes_demo    # rows + CLP annotations\n50\tbenny pypes rerun    <run_id> --from silver_trades --workspace pypes_demo\n51\t# --- pypes sandbox layer (advisory; never mutates run audit data) ---\n52\tbenny pypes plan         \"<requirement>\" --workspace W [--save] [--run] [--strategy auto|oneshot|incremental|swarm]  # LLM-author a draft manifest (auto picks incremental for local/thinking models)\n53\tbenny pypes agent-report <run_id>        --workspace W                    # one-shot risk-analyst Markdown narrative\n54\tbenny pypes bench        pandas=<m1> polars=<m2> --workspace W [--repeats N]   # head-to-head wall/CPU/RSS/cost\n55\tbenny pypes model-bench  manifests/templates/model_comparison_planner.json --workspace W [--judge] [--save-report out.md]   # cross-model time/cost/tokens/accuracy/quality\n56\tbenny pypes chat         <run_id>        --workspace W                    # multi-turn risk-analyst REPL grounded on the run\n57\t# --- agentamp — skinnable cockpit (Phases 1–6 shipped) ---\n58\tbenny agentamp scaffold-skin <id>  [--drafts-dir D]  # create deterministic draft (signature: null)\n59\tbenny agentamp pack   <draft_dir> --out <id>.aamp     # zip draft into .aamp\n60\tbenny agentamp sign   <id>.aamp                       # HMAC-SHA256 sign (uses BENNY_HMAC_KEY)\n61\tbenny agentamp install <id>.aamp [--workspace W]      # verify sig + register under $BENNY_HOME\n62\tbenny agentamp enqueue <manifest.json> [--workspace W] [--api-base URL] [--api-key KEY]  # enqueue run\n63\tbenny agentamp export-cockpit <out.aamp.cockpit>      # export user state + EQ to portable bundle\n64\tbenny age